{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle structure. The award was created in the 2000s. The Man Booker International Prize was created in 2004/2005. Let me think about the timing: \"the year in which this book was published\" in the 2010s, another book released the preceding year won the award.\n\nThe Vegetarian was published in English in 2016, won the Man Booker International Prize in 2016. But the prize is awarded for a book published in the preceding year. Let me check if The Vegetarian was translated into 25+ languages and was a contender for another award. Let me also reconsider - maybe the award is the International Booker Prize (reconfigured 2016).\n\nLet me look at the Man Booker International Prize Wikipedia page for details on creation and winners.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Booker International Prize Wikipedia created 2004 2005 history\", \"International Booker Prize Wikipedia established year history\", \"Man Booker International Prize founding 2004 original format\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_2c35ad35443648098dd3994c","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"The Vegetarian Han Kang translated into 25 languages number of languages\", \"Han Kang Vegetarian 25 languages translation\", \"The Vegetarian novel how many languages translated\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_ccd5ebb96e8741d08a1d9768","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789381194,"id":"chatcmpl-aa8f5006-4e7a-99b8-8ba8-44ed7c76f6f7","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":18957,"completion_tokens":251,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":19208,"cached_tokens":1536,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1536},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}